{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.FreeCumulants","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.FreeCumulants","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Choose.Central"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.classical_sub_free_eval_one_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.classical_sub_free_eval_one_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":191,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L191-L196","doc":"**Combinatorial signature of freeness.** The classical/free gap at the\nall-ones evaluation is `15 − 14 = 1`: exactly the single crossing\npartition removed by freeness, i.e. `|Partitions(4)| − |NC(4)| = B₄ − C₄`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.classicalMoment4_eval_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.classicalMoment4_eval_one","kind":"theorem","line":185,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L185-L189","doc":"The classical order-4 moment at all-ones is `15 = B₄` (the Bell number:\nall 15 partitions of `{1,2,3,4}`), **not** a Catalan number. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.freeMoment_eval_one_eq_catalanCount","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.freeMoment_eval_one_eq_catalanCount","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L170-L183","doc":"**NC-count bridge.** The free moments at all cumulants `= 1` are the\nCatalan numbers `C_n = centralBinom n / (n+1) = |NC(n)|`:\n`C₁ = 1, C₂ = 2, C₃ = 5, C₄ = 14`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.catalanCount_values","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.catalanCount_values","kind":"theorem","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L163-L168","doc":"The Catalan values `C₁ = 1, C₂ = 2, C₃ = 5, C₄ = 14`, expressed via\nMathlib's `Nat.centralBinom` (`C_n = centralBinom n / (n+1)`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.classical_sub_free_moment4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.classical_sub_free_moment4","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L147-L152","doc":"**Free/classical order-4 gap = the crossing partition.**\n`classicalMoment4 − freeMoment4 = κ₂²`, the contribution of the one\ncrossing pair-partition `{{1,3},{2,4}}` that freeness removes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.freeMoment4_recursion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.freeMoment4_recursion","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L131-L140","doc":"`m₄ = κ₁·m₃ + κ₂·(2·m₂ + m₁²) + κ₃·(3·m₁) + κ₄·m₀`.  The inner factor\n`2·m₂ + m₁²` is `∑_{i₁+i₂=2} m_{i₁}m_{i₂} = m₀m₂ + m₁m₁ + m₂m₀`, the\nnon-crossing fillings of the two gaps left by a size-2 first block. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.freeMoment3_recursion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.freeMoment3_recursion","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L125-L129","doc":"`m₃ = κ₁·m₂ + κ₂·(2·m₁) + κ₃·m₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.freeMoment2_recursion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.freeMoment2_recursion","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L120-L123","doc":"`m₂ = κ₁·m₁ + κ₂·m₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.classicalMoment4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.classicalMoment4","kind":"def","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L104-L109","doc":"The **classical** order-4 moment: identical to `freeMoment4` except the\npair-partition coefficient is `3` rather than `2`, because the classical\nsum runs over *all* 15 = `B₄` partitions, keeping the crossing pairing\n`{{1,3},{2,4}}` (an extra `κ₂²`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.freeMoment4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.freeMoment4","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L97-L102","doc":"`m₄ = κ₄ + 4 κ₁κ₃ + 2 κ₂² + 6 κ₁²κ₂ + κ₁⁴`.  The 14 = `C₄` terms are the\nnon-crossing partitions of `{1,2,3,4}`. The pair-partition coefficient is\n`2` — only `{{1,2},{3,4}}` and `{{1,4},{2,3}}` are non-crossing; the third\npairing `{{1,3},{2,4}}` **crosses** and is excluded. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.freeMoment3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.freeMoment3","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L93-L95","doc":"`m₃ = κ₃ + 3 κ₁κ₂ + κ₁³`  (NC(3) = all 5 partitions of `{1,2,3}`, all\nnon-crossing). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.freeMoment2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.freeMoment2","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L90-L91","doc":"`m₂ = κ₂ + κ₁²`  (NC(2): `{{1,2}}`, `{{1},{2}}`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.freeMoment1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.freeMoment1","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L87-L88","doc":"`m₁ = κ₁`  (NC(1) = {{1}}). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.freeMoment0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.freeMoment0","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/FreeCumulants.lean#L84-L85","doc":"Empty-partition convention: `m₀ = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}